Dependencies not covered by this notice
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

roscc links LLVM through the llvm-sys crate. LLVM is a separate work,
licensed Apache 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions, and is neither included in nor
distributed by this project. See the LLVM Project for its terms.

The RISC OS output formats this writer emits (Absolute, AIF, AOF) and the
APCS calling standard it follows are documented by RISC OS Open Ltd in the
DDE Code Standards. Those documents are not redistributed here. The formats
themselves are interfaces, not code, and nothing in this project reproduces
RISC OS Open or Acorn source.
